      "content": "i know i should ask my doctor but they're impossible to reach and i'm in way too much pain to just sit here and wait days for a call back. i just need to know if a standard dose like 200mg or 400mg would be alright just to get me through the night. i'm not looking to take a bunch of it, just enough to settle the swelling. is that really that dangerous?",
